      "act": "cold open",
      "scene": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
      "narration_text": "Jambo, Liam. This is Liam, in for Professor Bear. This channel runs on computational skepticism, which means no claim gets a pass for where it came from. A skill that nobody has tried to break isn't validated. It's just unrefuted. Here's how to judge a skill somebody else wrote before you trust it.",
